                                    "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                                    "args": {
                                      "text": [
                                        "Dot reads the\nprotections aloud.\nService stays\nwithin FOUR.\nFaults",
                                        "are logged. Public\npaths stay open.\nHomes are not\npledged against",
                                        "the repair debt.\nSlush asks whether\nthese apply to all\nthree",
                                        "proposals. They\ndo. He nods and\nputs away a fourth\nproposal."
                                      ],
